    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I'd seen her once since last summer—when the Hawks had played Dallas. She'd been there to cheer on her brother, but I re",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4238
        }
