      "words": 31
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I grinned, some of the pain fading into the background. It was so damn good to hear from her. I wanted to ask if everyth",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5611
        }
      ],
      "words": 63
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "This was casual. Fun. Easy. Most of our conversations focused on hockey. Not our families, not our love lives, not anyth",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5919
        }
      ],
      "words": 73
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Then why do I feel the need to keep it a secret from my brother?” she whispered",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8645
        }
      ],
      "words": 17
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I didn't have many regrets, but how things had gone down with Levi was at the top of the list. Over the years, I'd tried",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9004
        }
      ],
      "words": 45
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Part of me was tempted to tell her. I was so sick of keeping this secret, of holding it all inside. But I couldn't. Woul",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9737
        }
      ],
      "words": 51
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“All I can say is that I could've handled the situation better. And while it's no defense, I was young and immature. I'd",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10000
        }
      ],
      "words": 39
    },
    {
      "block": "原句12",
      "no": 12,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“You'd think so, but the company wanted to offer me half of what they offered Levi. For the same work.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11481
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句13",
      "no": 13,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "But it's what you meant. I looked into it afterward so I could pitch it to them. Apparently, they liked the idea so much",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15092
        }
      ],
      "words": 77
    },
    {
      "block": "原句14",
      "no": 14,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I know,” Logan said in a quiet, confident tone. “You did it because you care. Because it was wrong.”",
